  "details": "- CVE-2026-11972: stop tarfile._Stream.seek() from spinning past end of stream -\n  the loop read whole blocks according to the member size declared in the header\n  and ignored what read() returned, so a header announcing a huge size (e.g.\n  2**64) kept it going against an already exhausted stream and hung any\n  application walking an untrusted archive opened in streaming mode (mode='r|').\n  Backported from upstream CPython (gh-151981, GH-151982).",
